  "question": {
    "text": "The coefficient of <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup></math> in <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></msup></math> and the coefficient of <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup></math> in <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></msup></math> are equal, then the value of <math><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></math> is equal to"
  },
